<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-FRIDAY'S SCHEDULE OF MATCHES AT THE FRENCH OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRIDAY'S SCHEDULE OF MATCHES AT THE FRENCH OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schedule of matches at the French</p>
<p>Open tennis championships on Friday (all matches semifinals;</p>
<p>play starts 1100 GMT; prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Centre Court</p>
<p>Men's singles:</p>
<p>Filip Dewulf (Belgium) v Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil)</p>
<p>Patrick Rafter (Australia) v 16-Sergi Bruguera (Spain)</p>
<p>Women's doubles:</p>
<p>5-Mary Joe Fernandez/Lisa Raymond (U.S.) v 8-Alexandra</p>
<p>Fusai/Nathalie Tauziat (France)</p>
<p>Court 1</p>
<p>Women's doubles:</p>
<p>1-Gigi Fernandez (U.S.)/Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) v</p>
<p>3-Martina Hingis (Switzerland)/Arantxa Sanchez-Vicario (Spain)</p>
</text>
